                    <hi rendition="#italic">Deutsche diplomatisch-politische Korrespondenz</hi>,
                    press releases of the German Foreign Ministry.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d541-f2" n="16" xml:id="d541-f2-content">
                <p>For information regarding the modifications made at this time in the European
                    Commission of the Danube, see <ref target="frus1919Parisv13#pg_667">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>, The Paris Peace Conference,
                        1919, vol. <hi rendition="#small-caps">xiii</hi>, p. 667</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d541-f3" n="17" xml:id="d541-f3-content">
                <p>For report of the first public announcement, see telegram No. 1157, September 13,
                    from the Chargé in the Soviet Union, <ref target="#pg507">p. 507</ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
